wb-modbus-ext-scanner (1.4.0+wb100) stable; urgency=medium

  * Backport from 1.5.1: disable XON/XOFF flow control on the serial port,
    it silently dropped 0x11 and 0x13 bytes from responses
  * Backport from 1.5.1: set data bits and stop bits explicitly instead of
    inheriting them
  * Backport from 1.5.1: wait for a response with a timeout instead of
    waiting forever
  * Backport from 1.5.1: check the address in a response to avoid matching
    a false frame start
  * Build against the system libserialport again, the package failed to build
    otherwise

 -- Pavel Gasheev <pavel.gasheev@wirenboard.com>  Fri, 31 Jul 2026 15:00:00 +0300

